WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.139 --> 00:00:06.009
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, thanks everyone
that submitted questions for the Walking Dead

00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:07.009
Q&amp;A this week.

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:10.059
Lots of stuff to talk about so we’ll get
to that first but I also have a few updates

00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:11.369
at the end of the video.

00:00:11.369 --> 00:00:16.410
There were also a few things Scott Gimple
and Greg Nicotero Confirmed after the episode,

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:21.470
first was that the guy in the flashbacks wasn’t
Negan, he was crazy tattoo man.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.300
They’re doing something super secret with
Morgan.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:34.390
And there will be at least one new villain
that will rival the Governor in his level

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:37.969
of evilness.

00:00:37.969 --> 00:00:43.570
So careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode yet.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:44.829
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, here we go.

00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:49.940
Question 1 - Derp Muffin asks, do you think
Beth will reunite with the group?

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.829
Yes, I don’t think she’s going to die.

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:52.829
But it will probably be most of the season
before she sees them again.

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:56.480
I believe we won’t catch up with her till
the third episode.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:02.249
But presumably there will be some exposition
explaining how she got there and who those

00:01:02.249 --> 00:01:03.249
people are.

00:01:03.249 --> 00:01:06.070
I don’t think they’re doing the exact
same thing as they did with Terminus.

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.130
I did follow all the news from when they were
filming this season.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.980
So I don’t want to get into crazy spoilers.

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:14.850
But I can definitely say that other place
won’t be the same deal as Terminus.

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:17.530
They’re not just going to blow it up the
first time we see it.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:21.060
I think Beth’s arc this season is going
to be the natural progression from those Daryl

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.570
field trip episodes in season 4.

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:24.654
She’s just slowly growing up and learning
how to deal on her own.

00:01:24.654 --> 00:01:25.759
I think they’ll be drawing that out as much
as possible.

00:01:25.759 --> 00:01:29.560
But Emily Kinney is still a series regular
as far as I know, so even though she won’t

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.610
be with the Survivors, we’ll still see a
lot of her.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.439
Just in separate scenes.

00:01:34.439 --> 00:01:39.070
Question 2 - Edward asks, do you think Morgan
will reunite with the group by the next episode

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:42.450
or are they going to drag it out?

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:47.700
No, Scott Gimple confirmed that there would
be more Morgan but that it will largely be

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.469
separate.

00:01:49.469 --> 00:01:52.729
Kirkman and Gimple have both said that they
incorporated a lot more elements from the

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:54.040
comics this year.

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.860
That doesn’t mean they’re straight up
copying what happens in the comics, but if

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:01.260
you’ve read the comics, some people and
things will seem a lot more familiar.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:07.650
I feel like that’s them gently suggesting
everyone start reading the comics.

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:11.230
Right now I’m behind, so if you’re not
reading the comics yet don’t feel bad.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.260
I haven’t read All Out War yet.

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:19.310
I think Morgan will be just like the Beth
storyline, we’ll just see way less of him.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:23.920
They’ve already said the group will head
back to a big city that we’ve already been

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:25.150
to which is Atlanta.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:29.050
So it’s possible Morgan could also head
in that direction.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:37.840
I don’t think he’ll be a regular on the
show as part of the group till next year though.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.960
The actor that plays him says he loves coming
on, so even if he never becomes a series regular,

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.580
he’ll still keep coming back.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:46.110
Question 3 - Jasmine asks, do you think Gareth
will die this season or turn good and join

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.099
the Survivors?

00:02:48.099 --> 00:02:53.060
The actor that plays Gareth was promoted to
Series regular after the finale last year.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:56.730
So he’s going to be in several if not most
of the episodes this season.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:00.629
That doesn’t necessarily mean he’s going
to turn good or join the Survivors.

00:03:00.629 --> 00:03:05.790
I’ve seen a lot of theories that he and
any other people left from Terminus would

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.900
turn into the Hunters from the comics.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:11.660
They were already cannibals, the Hunters are
just much more mobile.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.340
It’s possible Gareth and who ever is left
from there could just haunt Rick and the Survivors

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.860
all season.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:22.680
Question 4 - Kaz asks, Where did Rick and
the Survivors go at the end after they reunited?

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.239
It seems like they headed in the opposite
direction from Terminus.

00:03:25.239 --> 00:03:28.980
They run into Father Gabriel in the teaser
for episode 2 and it looked like they were

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:29.980
way off somewhere else.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.629
I don’t know where his church is on the
map, but in the trail they’re seen approaching

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:34.680
it at night.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.440
So it’s not going to be a simple “save
gabriel” then go back to his place and chill

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.440
thing.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:45.260
All of the other trailer scenes inside the
church look like they’re from next week

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.260
too.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.849
Father Gabriel in the comics is a really interesting
character, so I’m going to be interested

00:03:48.849 --> 00:03:50.610
to see how much of that they include.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:54.849
In case you don’t want to know anything
about him, just turn the volume down till

00:03:54.849 --> 00:03:56.569
you see this tag go away.

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:57.569
Okay…

00:03:57.569 --> 00:04:01.650
Right after the apocalpyse Gabriel hoarded
supplies in his church and refused to let

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:02.650
people in.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:06.459
Very un-godly thing to do, he was afraid of
running low on food and water.

00:04:06.459 --> 00:04:10.680
So he carries around the guilt of the people
who died because of his selfishness.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:11.930
Okay spoilers over.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:17.799
If you guys want I can talk more about him
in next week’s video.

00:04:17.799 --> 00:04:24.970
Seth Gilliam is a great actor and gets them
one step closer to hiring every single actor

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.660
to ever appear on The Wire.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:33.510
Question 5 - Daniel asks, Will the show make
sense if I just start watching right now in

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:34.510
season 5?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:41.570
It will take you longer to develop connections
to the characters but you’ll still be able

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.950
to follow the story.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:46.570
Even though it’s highly serialized, they
write episodes knowing there are people watching

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:49.200
for the first time and people may not have
read the comics.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:56.320
So they add bits of exposition and moments
to explain what’s going on.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:01.030
Question 6 - shihab asks, why would they bring
Sam back just to kill him off at the beginning

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.010
of the episode?

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.010
Big shout out to The Penguin.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:09.550
They said they flew him in for one day just
so he could kneel at that trough and get killed.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:13.320
He was the redshirt they used to crank up
the threat level.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.760
Him and the guy right next to him.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:19.440
They just wanted us to feel like they were
actually going to kill everyone in there.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.820
Robin Lord Taylor for those who don’t know,
is The Penguin on Gotham.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.480
That show just got picked up for a full 22
episodes.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:28.430
It’s airs Monday nights and I do videos
for it every week.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:33.650
It’s a lot of fun so you should check it
out.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:37.380
Question 7 - horror geek asks, there are only
about 5 characters left from the original

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.440
pilot episode.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.390
How long do you think they’ll all survive?

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:47.770
I’m starting to think that they’ll keep
them indefinitely.

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:55.540
I know there was all the playful Negan winks
to a certain comic book moment.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:59.410
But I think the only time they kill off major
characters is when they sense the group gets

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:01.160
too comfortable.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.880
The minute everyone is safe and happy is when
we should all start worrying.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:09.591
I think that what we’ll see now is a rift
develope between Abraham’s group and the

00:06:09.591 --> 00:06:10.591
Survivors over the Cure.

00:06:10.591 --> 00:06:13.140
And that will create all the internal tension.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:16.820
Gareth and whoever else shows up will be the
external tension.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:20.001
There always has to be threats inside the
group and threats outside the group.

00:06:20.001 --> 00:06:21.680
If things get too crazy with Abraham’s group
though, I think it would be a lot more likely

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.680
that Abraham or Eugene would die.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:23.680
Abraham is the kind of guy who picks fights
and Eugene is Walker Bait without his protection.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.680
Question 8 - HR Productions asks, do you think
Gareth is the only one who survived Terminus?

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:25.680
No, but I do think most of them died.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:26.680
I think we’ll get an exact number in the
next two episodes.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:27.680
If they don’t show up next week.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.680
We also found out that the guy on the slab
here being cut up, was Gareth’s Brother

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.680
and Mary who got eaten by walkers was his
Mother.

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.680
Question 9 - Blacksmith Rage asks, do you
think Michonne will get her Katana Back?

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.680
I didn’t see Carol grab it, so I’m assuming
it’s still back at Terminus.

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.680
Michonne looks like she had it in the trailer
so it’s possible someone will circle back

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.680
and get it or Carol grabbed it and I just
missed it.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:37.640
Question 10 - Angus asks, do you think this
season will be a lot less standing around

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.970
and talking like when they were on the farm
and at the prison?

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:44.140
We know they head to the church with Father
Gabriel, but I’m not sure how long they’ll

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.140
stay there.

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.140
They will be traveling for most of the season,
so it’s possible they’ll drift from stop

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:47.510
to stop while they head to Atlanta.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.190
Gimple said we’d see familiar places and
a lot of new ones.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:51.190
So they won’t be settling down wherever
they go.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:53.640
Question 11 - Raul asks, do you think Carol
is a version of Andrea from the comics?

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.400
She was also a good sharpshooter and a bad
ass.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.580
They do share a lot of similar qualities.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:02.130
I don’t think they’ll have exactly the
same arc though.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.190
I think Andrea in the comics is kind of divided
between Michonne and Carol right now.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:10.560
Both those TV Characters share some parts
of Andrea’s story.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:14.780
Question 12 - Purely Awesome asks, why do
you think they chose not to show Tyreese killing

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:19.260
that Terminus Guy, why didn’t he want Carol
to go in the Cabin?

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:23.470
There is a small chance that he did not kill
the dude and he just doesn’t want Carol

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.490
to find out.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:28.960
I think Tyreese having a problem killing people
will work into the Gareth storyline and probably

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:33.370
cause some problems later on.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.840
They’ll definitely address it again.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.810
If you remember the Lizzie Mika storyline.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:43.190
They offhandedly started that with the Rats
in Season 4 Episode 1.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:47.630
So hopefully this won’t turn into a “look
at the flowers tyreese” situation.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:51.250
Thanks so much everyone for submitting questions.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:54.780
And congratulations to this week’s giveaway
winner, Oliver Yoshi.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:08:00.390
You win the amazon gift card this week.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.390
For those asking.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:02.630
It’s a new giveaway every week.

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:05.660
And I’m also doing giveaways in my Doctor
Who and Game of Thrones videos.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:09.490
Probably some other random giveaways too.

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:12.740
So the more different things you check out
the better your chances are of catching that

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.670
stuff.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:27.890
Next week, shit goes down with Father Gabriel,
I’ll probably have a bonus video before

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:28.990
the episode airs too.

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:31.111
Right now click here for my Episode 1 WTF
video and click here to learn all about the

00:08:31.111 --> 00:08:33.440
new walking dead spinoff show.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:40.200
Thanks for watching, now let’s all high
five and I’ll see you tonight for gotham!

